<title>USA: PCX to list Aksys, five other options.</title>
<headline>PCX to list Aksys, five other options.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Exchange (PCX) said Friday it would trade six new options from April 9.</p>
<p>The options would be on shares of Aksys Ltd, Cali Realty Corp, Compass Bancshares Inc, Hawaiian Electric Industries Inc, KN Energy Inc and Stone Energy Corp.</p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' strike prices, expiration months, position limits and market maker or pit representative.</p>
<p>	    Strikes	 Expir	Pos Limits  Mkt Maker/Rep</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    7-1/2, 10,    May, Jun,  4,500	 Paul Mandell/</p>
<p>	    12-1/2	  Jul, Oct		   Wm Brandreth</p>
<p>	    25, 30, 35    May, Jun,  7,500	 Todd Broome/</p>
<p>				Jul, Oct		   Bonnie Gibbons</p>
<p>	    25, 30, 35    May, Jun,  7,500	 Ron Goodman/</p>
<p>				 Jul, Oct		   Mark Weinstock</p>
<p>	    30, 35, 40    May, Jun,  4,500	 Lynn Jolly/</p>
<p>				 Aug, Nov		   Kit Woolsey</p>
<p>	    35, 40, 45    May, Jun,  4,500	 Lynn Jolly/</p>
<p>				 Aug, Nov		   Kit Woolsey</p>
<p>	    20, 22-1/2,   May, Jun,  7,500	 Paul Mandell/</p>
<p>	     25		Sep, Dec		   Wm Brandreth</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
